# a forbidden form (drops corpus accumulation, #124). The harness needs no seed to reach real code
# (confirmed: edges>0 without one), so per the spec a target with no seeds carries no directive.
# Permanent workaround pending Mayhem support for non-alphanumeric project names; see repos/fhir.resources.yaml notes.
